<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-SPAIN'S OLANO WINS TOUR'S 20TH STAGE TIME TRIAL.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-SPAIN'S OLANO WINS TOUR'S 20TH STAGE TIME TRIAL.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abraham Olano of Spain won the 20th stage of the Tour de France, a 63-km time trial starting and finishing at Disneyland Paris on Saturday.</p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany, who was second, retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
